From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SableOS <noreply@sableos.invalid>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 20:30:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] SableOS: lock screen Peek, one row per app

The locked glance's count row becomes the Peek, as BB10 and TenSeven show
it: "Peek · Notifications", then one row per app with its icon, name,
"N notifications" and the count (most first, at most four, then "+N more
apps"), and "Unlock to read message details" under it. Only when the
user's lock screen setting shows all content, and the notification needs
no redaction, does a row name the newest sender (the notification's title,
never its text). The private mode card now shows only for an empty peek.
Pure model in keyguard/sable/SableLockGlance.Peek.
